BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Photo Contest — Regenerative Agriculture: Fostering Resilient La
 ndscapes and Livelihoods
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260515T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260515T000000
UID:95190f50831187c52fbd1beb221dcfd9@sej.org
DESCRIPTION:Regenerative Agriculture: Fostering Resilient Landscapes and L
 ivelihoods is open to photographers worldwide\, of all levels\, from April
  15 to May 15\, 2026. The Sustainable Agriculture Network is looking for 
 images that show how regenerative agriculture sustains resilient ecosystem
 s\, living landscapes and the people who depend on them.\n\nCategories: Na
 tional (U.S.)\, International\, Awards and Grants\, Agriculture
URL:https://www.sej.org/calendar/photo-contest-regenerative-agriculture-fo
 stering-resilient-landscapes-and-livelihoods
X-SOURCE:Society of Environmental Journalists
